SOAPBOX: it was not to be the case. So 20m was the workhorse band,
SOAPBOX: although even conditions there seemed weak.  However I was
SOAPBOX: surprised to see 20 stay open well after sunset.  I probably
SOAPBOX: lingered there too long, but the 3 and 4 point QSOs and new grid
SOAPBOX: fields were too alluring.  Thanks for all the QSOs!
